{"seq":13,"slug":"international-economics","title":"国际经济学","stage":"DONE","category":"economics-finance","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/international-economics","rating":{"composite":3.95,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.26,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"国际经济学-简介\">国际经济学 简介</h1><p>国际经济学研究<strong>跨越国界的经济活动及其规律</strong>——商品与服务的国际流动、货币与资本的跨境配置，以及主权国家为此采取的政策博弈。它把封闭经济模型中被假定不存在的「国界」重新引入，由此产生了汇率、关税、国际收支、资本管制、区域一体化等一系列独有问题。本知识库面向已具备基本经济学直觉、希望系统理解开放经济运行机制的读者，尤其适合关心全球产业链、跨境业务与技术竞争制度背景的技术从业者。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-在经济学知识体系中的位置\">本 hub 在经济学知识体系中的位置</h2><p>国际经济学与经济学其它分支边界清晰，相邻 hub 各有分工，避免重复学习：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>归属 hub</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单一市场的价格、竞争、市场失灵</td>\n<td><a href=\"../microeconomics/market-structure/perfect-competition\">微观经济学</a></td>\n<td>微观给出本 hub 贸易理论所需的成本/竞争微观基础；本 hub 专注<strong>跨国</strong>资源配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一国总产出、就业、汇率制度</td>\n<td><a href=\"../macroeconomics/international-macroeconomics/exchange-rate-regimes\">宏观经济学</a></td>\n<td>宏观从单国视角讲开放经济；本 hub 从<strong>国家间相互作用</strong>视角讲贸易与金融</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>货币政策工具与央行运作</td>\n<td><a href=\"../monetary-policy-central-banking/central-banking-system/central-bank-functions-structure\">货币政策与中央银行</a></td>\n<td>央行 hub 讲国内货币传导；本 hub 讲<strong>国际货币体系</strong>与汇率决定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发展中国家的增长与贫困</td>\n<td><a href=\"../development-economics/global-development/trade-development\">发展经济学</a></td>\n<td>发展 hub 关注国内制度与增长；本 hub 提供其所依赖的<strong>贸易与开放</strong>框架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>谈判与策略均衡的形式工具</td>\n<td><a href=\"../game-theory/game-theory-applications/bargaining-theory\">博弈论</a></td>\n<td>博弈论提供贸易谈判/政策博弈的分析工具；本 hub 提供应用场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资本主义的制度演化与权力结构</td>\n<td><a href=\"../../political-economy/capitalism-origins-evolution/21st-century-capitalism/state-capitalism\">政治经济学</a></td>\n<td>政经 hub 关注制度与权力；本 hub 提供其讨论全球化时的<strong>经济机制</strong>支撑</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>简言之：<strong>微观/宏观是地基，本 hub 是把地基延伸到国界之外的那一层</strong>；央行、发展、政经等 hub 则从各自角度与本 hub 交叉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四章结构与内在逻辑\">四章结构与内在逻辑</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>第1章 国际贸易理论</strong>——回答「国家为何贸易、利益如何分配」，从李嘉图比较优势、赫克歇尔-俄林要素禀赋，到克鲁格曼新贸易理论与梅利兹异质企业模型，按理论演进时间线展开。</li>\n<li><strong>第2章 国际金融与汇率</strong>——回答「开放经济下货币与资本如何运行」，涵盖汇率决定、国际收支、资本流动与国际货币体系演变。</li>\n<li><strong>第3章 国际经济政策</strong>——回答「各国如何在交往中博弈」，包括关税与非关税壁垒、WTO 多边治理、经济制裁与产业政策。</li>\n<li><strong>第4章 区域经济一体化</strong>——回答「国家间如何深度整合」，从一体化阶段理论到欧盟、亚太与南南合作的现实案例。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>四章呈「理论→市场→政策→制度」的递进：前两章是分析工具，第三、四章是工具在政策与制度层面的应用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径-分人群\">推荐学习路径（分人群）</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>系统入门者（建议顺序学完）</strong>：第1章 → 第2章 → 第3章 → 第4章。先用前两章分别建立贸易与金融的理论基础，再进入政策与一体化的应用分析。</li>\n<li><strong>关心贸易摩擦/产业链的从业者</strong>：第1章（比较优势、新贸易理论）→ 第3章（贸易政策、WTO、产业政策、制裁）→ 第4章（区域协定）。可暂缓第2章金融内容。</li>\n<li><strong>关心汇率/跨境资金的金融从业者</strong>：第2章全章 → 第3章汇率与政策协调相关节 → 回看第1章建立贸易直觉。建议并读 <a href=\"../monetary-policy-central-banking/central-banking-system/central-bank-functions-structure\">货币政策与中央银行</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>关心全球化政治经济的读者</strong>：第1章（贸易利得分配）→ 第4章（一体化与南南合作）→ 第3章（制裁、产业政策），并对照 <a href=\"../../political-economy/capitalism-origins-evolution/21st-century-capitalism/state-capitalism\">政治经济学</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>必备</strong>：供求与价格机制、机会成本、边际分析等微观直觉（见 <a href=\"../microeconomics/market-structure/perfect-competition\">微观经济学</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>建议</strong>：GDP、通胀、利率等宏观基础概念（见 <a href=\"../macroeconomics/international-macroeconomics/exchange-rate-regimes\">宏观经济学</a>），便于理解第2章的汇率与国际收支。</li>\n<li><strong>进阶可选</strong>：博弈论中的纳什均衡与讨价还价模型（见 <a href=\"../game-theory/game-theory-applications/bargaining-theory\">博弈论</a>），有助于读懂第3章的政策博弈。</li>\n<li>不要求微积分；本 hub 的核心模型均以图形与直觉为主，少量代数推导会在正文中说明。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"trade-theory","title":"国际贸易理论","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/international-economics/trade-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"comparative-advantage","title":"比较优势与李嘉图模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/international-economics/trade-theory/comparative-advantage"},{"seq":2,"slug":"heckscher-ohlin","title":"赫克歇尔-俄林模型与要素禀赋","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/international-economics/trade-theory/heckscher-ohlin"},{"seq":3,"slug":"new-trade-theory","title":"新贸易理论与规模经济","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/international-economics/trade-theory/new-trade-theory"},{"seq":4,"slug":"trade-policy","title":"贸易政策与保护主义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/international-economics/trade-theory/trade-policy"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"international-finance","title":"国际金融与汇率","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/international-economics/international-finance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"exchange-rate-theory","title":"汇率理论与汇率决定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/international-economics/international-finance/exchange-rate-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"balance-of-payments","title":"国际收支与全球失衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/international-economics/international-finance/balance-of-payments"},{"seq":3,"slug":"international-monetary-system","title":"国际货币体系演变","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/international-economics/international-finance/international-monetary-system"},{"seq":4,"slug":"capital-flows","title":"国际资本流动与金融危机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/international-economics/international-finance/capital-flows"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"international-policy","title":"国际经济政策","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/international-economics/international-policy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"trade-agreements","title":"贸易协定与多边贸易体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/international-economics/international-policy/trade-agreements"},{"seq":2,"slug":"wto-governance","title":"WTO 治理与多边贸易秩序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/international-economics/international-policy/wto-governance"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sanctions-economics","title":"经济制裁与地缘经济","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/international-economics/international-policy/sanctions-economics"},{"seq":4,"slug":"industrial-policy","title":"产业政策与国际竞争","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/international-economics/international-policy/industrial-policy"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"regional-integration","title":"区域经济一体化","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/international-economics/regional-integration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"integration-theory","title":"区域经济一体化理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/international-economics/regional-integration/integration-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"eu-integration","title":"欧盟一体化与欧元区","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/international-economics/regional-integration/eu-integration"},{"seq":3,"slug":"asia-pacific-integration","title":"亚太经济一体化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/international-economics/regional-integration/asia-pacific-integration"},{"seq":4,"slug":"south-south-cooperation","title":"南南合作与新兴经济体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/international-economics/regional-integration/south-south-cooperation"}]}]}